@startuml
title Relational Access V1 - L2 Direct Multi-DataSource
autonumber

participant "Component Repository" as Repo
participant "StorageRouteResolver" as Route
participant "RoutingMyBatisAccessResolver" as Resolver
participant "SpringMyBatisAccess(db-01)" as Access
participant "SqlSessionTemplate(db-01)" as Session
database "Physical DB db-01" as DB

Repo -> Route : resolve(shardKey)
Route --> Repo : db-01 + physical_table_03
Repo -> Resolver : resolve("db-01")
Resolver --> Repo : Access(db-01)
Repo -> Access : execute*(Mapper, physical_table_03)
Access -> Access : verify current tx uses db-01
Access -> Session : getMapper(ComponentMapper)
Session -> DB : physical SQL
DB --> Repo : result

note over Access,DB
DirectMyBatisResourceRegistry creates the Access,
SqlSessionTemplate and TransactionExecutor from the same DataSource.
end note
@enduml
